      <content:encoded>&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;根据高盛主经纪业务数据，对冲基金正在以十年来最快的速度减持AI股票，过去20个交易日的累计净卖出强度已偏离五年均值约3个标准差，强度达到2016年以来最大。&lt;br/&gt;来源：高盛&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/svmtgllD-5yXi4l5p9TUwPfyb0pqNOr2Iu3dWxAh3YOWqMTaiMmAVH5b1QwxuCe4luY9Hf_wdnVFxLog54H6LJKOr5laiaTpN4jRoH8UUzLoBnw9vPD7CUDFcgM9evEBVLJPZ4idt7ahpTnR6iqpAsbyn38QkpUna9jN_V1CGg45VZeiV6hr1sSGqk9mtDTST-uYIqbyq_DbtnhXMj8ijboO8P4oM0OI-nsI73SxVevyiiD52io9_SXOTamjI_AUDJOnIQnSIB1r6gwcBRNLkx6t_LaXcBXdaxeZPFd--fFJQ_JEbYYRjyboYJ0AGBru9SJEr5QZywBA_OtK6tty4g.jpg" alt="Telegram post image" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded>
